erification","html":"原书OCR文本陈述已逐项比对；证明核验范围见Remark"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 为集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\to\\subseteq A\\times A\">\\(\\to\\subseteq A\\times A\\)</span>；单关系抽象归约系统见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"89129816153530db\" href=\"?note=89129816153530db\" title=\"56-df-abstract-reduction-system\">56-df-abstract-reduction-system</a>。</li>\n<li>强正规化、局部合流、合流见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"251992a231a52348\" href=\"?note=251992a231a52348\" title=\"56-df-strongly-normalizing\">56-df-strongly-normalizing</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"766a1d5bf25248d1\" href=\"?note=766a1d5bf25248d1\" title=\"56-df-locally-confluent\">56-df-locally-confluent</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"c74959a8cb14eaa5\" href=\"?note=c74959a8cb14eaa5\" title=\"56-df-confluent\">56-df-confluent</a>；工作于ZFC。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(\\mathrm{SN}(A,\\to)\\land\\mathrm{LocallyConfluent}(A,\\to))\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{Confluent}(A,\\to).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(\\mathrm{SN}(A,\\to)\\land\\mathrm{LocallyConfluent}(A,\\to))\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{Confluent}(A,\\to).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>核对了原书陈述及第二个良基归纳证明。对起点a按严格归约作归纳；非零峰先取首步a→b′、a→c′，局部合流给b′→*d′←*c′。对b′的归纳性质先合并b与d′，再对c′的归纳性质合并c与所得共同后继，即得原峰共同后继。原文件无前提的“任意b,c有共同后继”已删除。</p>\n<p>来源定位中的 <code>source_ocr_blocks</code> 指本地提取文本的页块序号，不宣称是DjVu物理页码；印刷页已按该页页眉或页脚核对。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-strongly-normalizing","status":"resolved","id":"251992a231a52348","anchor":"ref-1